      en: ["The school house was built in the early 20th century.", "It is located on the island of 'Eua, southeast of Tongatapu.", "Missionaries established it as the island's first school.", "The structure is made almost entirely of native hardwood.", "It is one of the oldest surviving buildings on 'Eua.", "The building now often serves as a community hall or museum."],
      es: ["La escuela fue construida a principios del siglo XX.", "Se encuentra en la isla 'Eua, al sureste de Tongatapu.", "Los misioneros la utilizaron como la primera escuela de la isla.", "La estructura consiste casi totalmente en madera dura.", "Es uno de los edificios preservados más antiguos de 'Eua.", "Hoy en día, a menudo se utiliza como centro comunitario o museo."],
